  "title": "Lemon Cheese Cake",
  "description": "This lemon cheese cake is a 3-layer cake with homemade lemon curd filling; boxed yellow cake mix and instant vanilla pudding make this cake a breeze!",
  "authors": [
    "Diane Pace"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-07-06T14:05:23-04:00",
